<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><div><font face="arial">If you have decided to delay your first semester at Arizona State University, you should <a href="https://students.asu.edu/deferadmissions">defer your admission</a>. Consider your options carefully before taking this step.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Typical reasons for deferring your admission include: involuntary military activation, ecclesiastical service or volunteer service.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The admission deferment guarantees only admission into the university and not necessarily admission to a particular major or program of study. You may defer your admission for a period of up to five terms or two and a half years.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">To learn more or to defer your admission, visit <a href="http://students.asu.edu/deferadmissions">students.asu.edu/deferadmissions</a>.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Admission Services</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>